              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuli mbumunywide acilundu cangu cisalala, bamasi boonse bayoonywa mbubonya obo ciindi coonse. Bayoonywa akukolwa, elyo bayooba mbuli mbubatabede.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.16",
