              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luzubo lwaJakobo luyooba mulilo aluzubo lwa-Josefa luyooba mabangabanga, aluzubo lwa-Esau luyooba zisikosiko ziyumide. Bayoobatenta akubamaninizya, nkabela takukooyooba uusyaala muluzubo lwa-Esau, Mbwaamba Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
